        <pyqgis_plugin name="POI Lookup" version="0.2.5">
            <description>Lookup Assets Based On POI</description>
            <about>POI Lookup This algorithm takes a XY Point and generates a map of features around the point. Input LAT, LON Coordinate: LAT and LON Coordinate of the point. The LAT and LON must be deliminated by either a space or a comma Input Map Scale: Scale factor to zoom into the entered point. 50 - 100 is usually a good starting place. Larger number zoom out. The lowest scale is 10. Input Append Map Scale: The will append the scale factor to the end of the output filename. Output PDF File: Path to the output PDF file.</about>
            <version>0.2</version>
            <qgis_minimum_version>3.34</qgis_minimum_version>
            <qgis_maximum_version>3.99</qgis_maximum_version>
            <homepage>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Pasaltran/POI/main/README.html</homepage>
            <file_name>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Pasaltran/POI/main/FS_POILookup.zip</file_name>
            <icon>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Pasaltran/POI/main/icon.png</icon>
            <author>Scott Buchanan</author>
            <email>scott.buchanan@fibersense.com</email>
        </pyqgis_plugin>
